msgid "Defaults for new timers and the Record button. Each timer, and a recording started with \"Record with options…\", can change them.\nTS: video, all audio tracks, subtitles, teletext and EPG data. MKV: video, several audio tracks and subtitles. MPG: video and several audio tracks. MP4: video and one audio track. Internet streams have no teletext, subtitles or EPG data; HLS and DASH streams are recorded with one audio track."
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe do lasca ama nua agus don chnaipe Taifead. Is féidir le gach lasc ama, agus taifeadadh a thosaítear le “Taifead le roghanna…”, iad a athrú.\nTS: físeán, gach rian fuaime, fotheidil, teilithéacs agus sonraí EPG. MKV: físeán, roinnt rianta fuaime agus fotheidil. MPG: físeán agus roinnt rianta fuaime. MP4: físeán agus rian fuaime amháin. Níl teilithéacs, fotheidil ná sonraí EPG ag sruthanna idirlín; taifeadtar sruthanna HLS agus DASH le rian fuaime amháin."

